#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate using your [IBM Quantum Platform API key](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and select the Qiskit Function as follows:\n"
msgstr "Autentícate con tu [clave de API de IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) y selecciona la Qiskit Function de la siguiente manera:\n"

